<title>UK: TABLE-NFC H1 pretax pre-exceps up 13 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NFC H1 pretax pre-exceps up 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.3		vs 3.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.5		vs 2.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    50.1	     vs 44.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,172.5	  vs 1,178.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British distribution group is NFC Plc. The company said it expected to pay an unchanged dividend for the full year. The comparative figures, previously for the 28 weeks to April 13, 1996, have been restated to show the six months to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
